🇺🇸🇺🇦🇷🇺 Russian Fiber Optic Drones Operating in Slavyansk

▪️Reports including footage from within Slavyansk of crystal clear video transmission all the way to impact indicate Russian drone operators are using fiber optic guided drones inside the urban environment;

▪️Fiber optic guided drones have a physical connection (a thin fiber optic wire) between the drone and the operator controlling it, meaning it cannot be jammed and will not lose its signal;

▪️Radio operated drone footage often features breaking up of the signal near impact either through jamming or the fact that its signal is lost the closer to the ground it gets, blocked by obstacles (hills, buildings, forest) between it and the operator;

▪️The Slavyansk/Kramatorsk area is one of the last major urban centers in the Donbass still under Ukrainian control;
